# AGENTS.md

_Read on demand (not `@included`)._

## Models

- **Primary:** {{PRIMARY_MODEL}}
- **Subagents:** native Claude Code Agent tool

## Subagents

- Maximum 3 simultaneously
- Use for: searching the codebase, running checks, parallel research

## Recall

- **Default:** local keyword recall — `local-recall.mjs` greps the cold memory corpus and injects
  the top matches. No server, no network.
- **Optional:** OpenViking semantic recall — see `optional/openviking/` (off by default). Enable
  only if you run a local OpenViking instance.
